### Smoke test (GET — expects 405)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Router
Authorization: {{token}}

### LoadSpecialtyData
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Router
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "ChatHealthyTask": "LoadSpecialtyData"
}

### LoadProviderData — dev run (200K records, 5 workers)
### file_url and version are optional — omit to auto-discover from cms.gov/nppes
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Router
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "ChatHealthyTask": "LoadProviderData",
    "payload": {
        "num_workers": 5,
        "max_records": 200000,
        "batch_size": 500,
        "blob_container": "provider-data"
    }
}

### LoadProviderData — check orchestration status (paste instance_id from 202 response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/runtime/webhooks/durabletask/instances/{{instanceId}}
Authorization: {{token}}
